e. monitoring the interests and rights of the victim in the examination process at the police, prosecutor's office and court;
f. protecting the privacy and confidentiality of the victim from all parties who have no interest, including coverage by mass media;
g. coordinating with other assistants; and
h. providing continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage.

